Project Foo                              │ apiVersion: apps/v1
═══════════                              │ kind: Deployment
                                         │ metadata:
Project Foo provides a fast, reliable    │   name: nginx
way to frobnicate widgets from the       │   namespace: web
command line. It is designed to feel     │   labels:
familiar to anyone who has used less,    │     app: nginx
grep, or other classic Unix tools.       │     tier: frontend
                                         │ spec:
CI                                       │   replicas: 3
                                         │   selector:
Installation                             │     matchLabels:
────────────                             │       app: nginx
                                         │   template:
Install from crates.io:                  │     metadata:
                                         │       labels:
▏ cargo install foo                      │         app: nginx
                                         │     spec:
Or download a prebuilt binary from the   │       containers:
releases page.                           │         [0]
                                         │           name: nginx
  From source                            │           image: nginx:1.27-alpine
                                         │           ports:
▏ git clone https://example.com/foo.git  │             [0]
▏ cd foo                                 │               containerPort: 80
▏ cargo build --release                  │               protocol: TCP
                                         │           env:
Usage                                    │             [0]
─────                                    │               name: LOG_LEVEL
                                         │               value: info
Basic invocation:                        │           resources:
                                         │             requests:
▏ foo input.txt --output result.txt      │               cpu: 100m
                                         │               memory: 128Mi
Common flags:                            │             limits:
                                         │               cpu: 500m
┌──────┬────────────────┐                │               memory: 512Mi
│ Flag │ Description    │                │           readinessProbe:
├──────┼────────────────┤                │             httpGet:
│ -v   │ verbose output │                │               path: /healthz
│ -q   │ quiet mode     │                │               port: 80
│ -o   │ output file    │                │             initialDelaySeconds: 5
└──────┴────────────────┘                │       restartPolicy: Always
                                         │ 
▌ Note: Foo reads from stdin when no     │ 
▌ input file is given.                   │ 
                                         │ 
